{"seq":4,"slug":"refactoring","title":"重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/refactoring","wordCount":1003,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"重构\">重构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重构类功能与导航类功能的根本区别在于：它会<strong>修改代码</strong>，而不只是读取代码。这带来两个额外要求——操作必须经过用户确认，且编辑必须跨文件一致。LSP 用一套统一模型承载这些要求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CodeAction</td>\n<td>描述「一个可执行的操作」（含 kind、edit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WorkspaceEdit</td>\n<td>描述「一组跨文件编辑」的统一载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CodeActionKind</td>\n<td>用层级前缀给操作分类（quickfix/refactor/source）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论是快速修复、重命名、Code Lens 还是保存时的整理导入，最终都归结为「生成一个 WorkspaceEdit 交给客户端应用」——这就是理解本主题的主线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"code-actions-概览\">Code Actions 概览</h2><p>Code Actions 是 LSP 中最灵活的功能之一，涵盖快速修复、代码重构和源操作三大类。编辑器在用户光标位置或选区范围内请求可用的操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CodeActionParams {&#10;  textDocument: TextDocumentIdentifier;&#10;  range: Range;&#10;  context: CodeActionContext;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CodeActionContext {&#10;  diagnostics: Diagnostic[];&#10;  only?: CodeActionKind[];&#10;  triggerKind?: CodeActionTriggerKind;&#10;}&#10;&#10;namespace CodeActionKind {&#10;  export const QuickFix = &#39;quickfix&#39;;&#10;  export const Refactor = &#39;refactor&#39;;&#10;  export const RefactorExtract = &#39;refactor.extract&#39;;&#10;  export const RefactorInline = &#39;refactor.inline&#39;;&#10;  export const RefactorRewrite = &#39;refactor.rewrite&#39;;&#10;  export const Source = &#39;source&#39;;&#10;  export const SourceOrganizeImports = &#39;source.organizeImports&#39;;&#10;  export const SourceFixAll = &#39;source.fixAll&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span 