/pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;编辑器显示&quot;&#10;        CL1[&quot;3 references | Run Test&quot;]&#10;        FUNC[&quot;function processOrder(order: Order) {&quot;]&#10;        CL2[&quot;12 references&quot;]&#10;        CLASS[&quot;class OrderService {&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"编辑器显示\"\n        CL1[\"3 references | Run Test\"]\n        FUNC[\"function processOrder(order: Order) {\"]\n        CL2[\"12 references\"]\n        CLASS[\"class OrderService {\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟 resolve</td>\n<td>初始只返回位置，command 在 resolve 时计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动刷新</td>\n<td>代码变更后自动重新请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可操作</td>\n<td>点击 CodeLens 执行绑定的 Command</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能注意</td>\n<td>大文件中 CodeLens 数量可能很多，需优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Code Lens 的 resolve 与补全的 resolve 类似，都是为了避免在初始请求中计算昂贵的信息。尤其是引用计数，需要全项目扫描。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"source-actions\">Source Actions</h2><p>Source Actions 是在文件级别执行的操作，通常在保存时自动触发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const saveActions: Record&lt;string, () =&gt; WorkspaceEdit&gt; = {&#10;  &#39;source.organizeImports&#39;: () =&gt; organizeImports(),&#10;  &#39;source.fixAll&#39;: () =&gt; fixAllDiagnostics(),&#10;  &#39;source.addMissingImports&#39;: () =&gt; addAllMissingImports(),&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> saveActions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceEdit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'source.organizeImports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> organizeImports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'source.fixAll'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fixAllDiagnostics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'source.addMissingImports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addAllMissingImports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见的 Source Actions：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>Kind</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整理导入</td>\n<td>source.organizeImports</td>\n<td>排序并移除未使用导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复全部</td>\n<td>source.fixAll</td>\n<td>应用所有首选快速修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复全部（ESLint）</td>\n<td>source.fixAll.eslint</td>\n<td>仅应用 ESLint 修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加缺失导入</td>\n<td>source.addMissingImports</td>\n<td>自动添加所有缺失导入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;editor.codeActionsOnSave&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;source.organizeImports&quot;: &quot;explicit&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source.fixAll&quot;: &quot;explicit&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"editor.codeActionsOnSave\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source.organizeImports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explicit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source.fixAll\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explicit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((重构))&#10;    Code Actions&#10;      quickfix 快速修复&#10;      refactor 提取/内联/改写&#10;      source 保存时操作&#10;    重命名&#10;      prepareRename 验证&#10;      rename 跨文件编辑&#10;      WorkspaceEdit 批量变更&#10;    Code Lens&#10;      行上方元信息&#10;      延迟 resolve&#10;      引用计数/测试运行&#10;    Source Actions&#10;      organizeImports&#10;      fixAll&#10;      保存时自动执行&#10;    操作分类&#10;      kind 层级结构&#10;      isPreferred 首选&#10;      disabled 不可用原因\">mindmap\n  root((重构))\n    Code Actions\n      quickfix 快速修复\n      refactor 提取/内联/改写\n      source 保存时操作\n    重命名\n      prepareRename 验证\n      rename 跨文件编辑\n      WorkspaceEdit 批量变更\n    Code Lens\n      行上方元信息\n      延迟 resolve\n      引用计数/测试运行\n    Source Actions\n      organizeImports\n      fixAll\n      保存时自动执行\n    操作分类\n      kind 层级结构\n      isPreferred 首选\n      disabled 不可用原因</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Code Actions</strong> 分为 quickfix、refactor 和 source 三大类，通过 <code>kind</code> 层级结构分类。</li>\n<li>重构操作支持**提取（extract）、内联（inline）和改写（rewrite）**三种模式。</li>\n<li><strong>重命名</strong>由 prepareRename + rename 两步组成，支持跨文件的 WorkspaceEdit 批量变更。</li>\n<li><strong>Code Lens</strong> 在代码行上方显示可操作的元信息，采用懒 resolve 模式延迟计算。</li>\n<li><strong>Source Actions</strong> 在文件级别运行，支持保存时自动执行（如整理导入和修复全部）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重构","id":"重构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Code Actions 概览","id":"code-actions-概览"},{"level":2,"text":"Code Action 实现","id":"code-action-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"重命名","id":"重命名"},{"level":2,"text":"Code Lens","id":"code-lens"},{"level":2,"text":"Source Actions","id":"source-actions"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代码导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/navigation"},"next":{"title":"DAP 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/dap-architecture"}}